{"schema_version":1,"type":"work","title":"赤鳳髓","authors":[{"name":"周履靖","role":"撰","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bf46"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"千頃堂書目","source_bid":"d59f2mel8d1c","title_info":"周履靖赤鳳髓","summary":"周履靖赤鳳髓"}],"description":{"text":"周履靖撰。三卷。見著錄於《千頃堂書目》。其著錄之文，《千頃堂書目》作「周履靖赤鳳髓」。本書惟《千頃堂書目》一志著錄，別無他證。《千頃堂書目》清黃虞稷撰——本書之目賴之以存。","sources":["千頃堂書目"]},"juan_count":{"number":3},"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":3}],"measure_info":"三卷","period_upper":"qing","period_upper_basis":"catalog_bound：唯一著錄源《千頃堂書目》成書於清初（黃虞稷 1629-1691），故不晚於 qing；書內小注無朝代線索，period 留 null 不猜","id":"d59f6er3yc5e","revision":"1.0.1","revised_at":"2026-09-07","resources":[{"name":"维基文库","type":"text","id":"wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%B5%A4%E9%B3%B3%E9%AB%93"}],"has_text":true,"_path":"Work/c/5/e/d59f6er3yc5e-赤鳳髓.json","_isDraft":false}